"female","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":50,"text":"der Wirtschaftssektor","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":51,"text":"der/die Zeitzeuge/-zeugin","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"m/f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":51,"text":"der/die Zeitzeuge/-zeugin","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m/f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Als ehemaliger Pressesprecher blickt Herr Berger oft auf jenen Abend zurück „Hätte ich die Formulierung genauer geprüft wäre das Missverständnis vermieden worden gibt er zu Der damalige Bundeskanzler hätte sich wohl anders entschieden wenn er von einem echten Zeitzeugen vorab gewusst hätte Manche Historiker sind sich sicher Wäre die Öffentlichkeit früher informiert worden hätte man den Skandal wohl verhindern können Herr Berger widerspricht dem jedoch Im Nachhinein lasse sich vieles leicht behaupten","authoredText":"Als ehemaliger Pressesprecher blickt Herr Berger oft auf jenen Abend zurück. „Hätte ich die Formulierung genauer geprüft, wäre das Missverständnis vermieden worden \", gibt er zu. Der damalige Bundeskanzler hätte sich wohl anders entschieden, wenn er von einem echten Zeitzeugen vorab gewusst hätte. Manche Historiker sind sich sicher: Wäre die Öffentlichkeit früher informiert worden, hätte man den Skandal wohl verhindern können. Herr Berger widerspricht dem jedoch: Im Nachhinein lasse sich vieles leicht behaupten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Interview: Ein früherer Pressesprecher erinnert sich","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Lea, du hast doch fast das Vorstellungsgespräch verpasst?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ja, der Zug hatte Verspätung.","speaker":"Lea","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Hätte ich früher losgehen müssen, wäre das nicht passiert.","speaker":"Lea","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Na ja, du hättest ja nicht wissen können, dass er ausfällt.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Stimmt, aber ich wäre trotzdem lieber eine halbe Stunde früher gefahren.","speaker":"Lea","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Lea, du hast doch fast das Vorstellungsgespräch verpasst?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ja, der Zug hatte Verspätung. Hätte ich früher losgehen müssen, wäre das nicht passiert.","speaker":"Lea","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Na ja, du hättest ja nicht wissen können, dass er ausfällt.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Stimmt, aber ich wäre trotzdem lieber eine halbe Stunde früher gefahren.","speaker":"Lea","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_031_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Hätte ich früher losgehen müssen, wäre das nicht passiert.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Du hast fast das Vorstellungsgespräch verpasst. Sag, was falsch lief.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Ich hätte den früheren Zug nehmen sollen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund fragt, was du anders machen würdest.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich hätte mich früher bewerben müssen, dann wäre es gegangen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt, warum du Rechtswissenschaft nicht studiert hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Du hättest es nicht wissen können, das war nicht dein Fehler.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Ein Freund ärgert sich über eine Entscheidung. Tröste ihn.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Ich hätte die Stelle annehmen sollen. — Und ich hätte dir früher davon erzählen müssen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-31-konjunktiv2-vergangenheit","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr sprecht über eine verpasste Chance.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":7,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":51,"vword-voice-M":51,"vword-listen":51,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Bäuche","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":7,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Erkenntnisse","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":19,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":4,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Grenzen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Steine","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Stellungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Westen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Angstreaktionen","from":"vocab-